    "objetivo": "Recognise and read the passato remoto, the tense of stories, history books, biographies and novels. Learn the regular endings, especially the third person singular and plural, the most common irregular verbs, and the use of «nel» with a year. Avoid the English-speaker traps: leaving out the accent in «chiamò» and «partì», using the singular ending with «loro», and «in» before a year.",
